  (text "NOT FOR FABRICATION. LMR51460 library checks passed; passives are sizing placeholders.\nVIN_SELECTED: protected battery/bench 6–8.4 V or qualified USB PD 15 V.\n+3V3: external always-on supervisor supply. MAIN_EN: qualified hardware permission, default low.\nPG_MAIN does not prove Jetson's 4.75–5.25 V window. Add independent voltage qualification.\nC5/C6 plus C7/C8: proposed bank; confirm effective capacitance, ESR, stability and startup.\nNT1: join analog and power ground beside IC as required by TI. No full carrier sequencing here."
    (at 35.56 142.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e804c204-7a04-48d1-bf51-bf652fdcf79f")
  )
